```js
const res = db.products.updateOne(
  { _id: 1, stock: { $gte: 2 } },
  { $inc: { stock: -2 } }
)
// res.modifiedCount === 0 -> not enough stock
```

```sql
BEGIN;
UPDATE products SET stock = stock - 1
WHERE product_id = 1 AND stock >= 1;
-- 0 rows -> ROLLBACK, sold out
INSERT INTO orders (customer_id, product_id, qty, status)
VALUES (7, 1, 1, 'reserved');
COMMIT;
```
Read committed पर यह safe है क्योंकि दूसरा UPDATE row lock का इंतज़ार करता है, फिर committed row पर WHERE clause को दोबारा evaluate करता है।
